icture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "SilverGolfer", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVCkzkeH.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/aPkMv4EfsbZy.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [{"reference": "/scale/d0vqbfdKtTuTNEeo.jpeg", "width": 494, "content-type": "jpeg", "height": 768}], "blurhash": "UNQ]+wR+oeRj~q%MRjWBt7M{a#ayIVWBxuof", "full_resolution": [1357, 873]}, "title": "So the Republicans are going to throw the midterms to try to get rid of Trump. There is obviously a larger Plan at play (whether it will work or not, I have no way of knowing) but the thing I cannot get/find it hard to accept is, why hasn't Trump just exposed the goddamn TRUTH about the conspiracy?", "last_comment_created": 1788798867365, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": true, "comments": 21, "score_up": 26, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVCl01Uu", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 20, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8821810, "raw_content": "", "author": "Toobigtorig1234", "created": 1788790087455, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "www.thegatewaypundit.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVCl01Uu.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://www.thegatewaypundit.com/2026/09/cops-called-ohio-democrat-nominee-amy-actons-home/", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Lindsay Clancy syndrome: Cops Called to Ohio Democrat Nominee Amy Acton\u2019s Home During Drunken Rage \u2014 Terrified Daughter Called Police Saying \u201cMom Has Been Drinking and Throwing Things\u201d", "last_comment_created": 1788790087455, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 0, "score_up": 20, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "Ohio Democratic gubernatorial candidate and radical COVID-lockdown architect Amy Acton had an absolute trainwreck of a weekend, demonstrating once again why\u2026", "large_image": "LGBoUE3Dcvl6LjdM.png", "title": "Cops Called to Ohio Democrat Nominee Amy Acton\u2019s Home During Drunken Rage \u2014 Terrified Daughter Called Police Saying \u201cMom Has Been Drinking and Throwing Things\u201d * The Gateway Pundit * by Jim H\u1d0fft"}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "text", "uuid": "1ATVCkzkeG", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 26, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8821740, "raw_content": "Graham Hancock claimed on Steven Bartlett\u2019s The Diary of a CEO in June that there's evidence of a global catastrophe 6000-12000 years ago near the beginning of the Younger Dryas. I believe he put it at 12800 years ago. I have to agree with one of his points that our current history is hard to believe - are we really supposed to believe that our genetical ancestors (homo sapiens) have existed for 200,000 years, but only started building civilisation 5000-6000 years ago? I can believe that only if those homo sapiens were the ones living in current day Africa and Pakistan but the white ancestors of the British, Dutch, German, the French, there is no way they would have lived tens or over a hundred thousand years without building civilisations and leaving traces behind. So what exactly happened?\r\n\r\nI also noticed that the white race seems to have adapted to survive in extremely cold climates. The skin pigment was lost (lighter skin) because protection against the sun was not needed anymore and the cock is a grower to be better protected against extreme colds. The social tendencies of high trust societies and mental preference for 'being correct' over 'being liked' are also adaptations to harsh cold climates where survival depends on doing the functionally right things. Warmer climates are more forgiving and people that are adapted to those, like our supposed ancestors that left Africa 60-70k years ago, are more social-centric.\r\n\r\nSo what happened 6 to 12 thousand years ago? What is the lost history? Are there some theories they are not telling us about? I would love to hear if people have more information on this topic.", "author": "artifex_mundi_x", "created": 1788784890686, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "SnowSnake", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "the forgotten history", "last_comment_created": 1788792176875, "content": "<p>Graham Hancock claimed on Steven Bartlett\u2019s The Diary of a CEO in June that there's evidence of a global catastrophe 6000-12000 years ago near the beginning of the Younger Dryas. I believe he put it at 12800 years ago. I have to agree with one of his points that our current history is hard to believe - are we really supposed to believe that our genetical ancestors (homo sapiens) have existed for 200,000 years, but only started building civilisation 5000-6000 years ago? I can believe that only if those homo sapiens were the ones living in current day Africa and Pakistan but the white ancestors of the British, Dutch, German, the French, there is no way they would have lived tens or over a hundred thousand years without building civilisations and leaving traces behind. So what exactly happened?</p>\n<p>I also noticed that the white race seems to have adapted to survive in extremely cold climates. The skin pigment was lost (lighter skin) because protection against the sun was not needed anymore and the cock is a grower to be better protected against extreme colds. The social tendencies of high trust societies and mental preference for 'being correct' over 'being liked' are also adaptations to harsh cold climates where survival depends on doing the functionally right things. Warmer climates are more forgiving and people that are adapted to those, like our supposed ancestors that left Africa 60-70k years ago, are more social-centric.</p>\n<p>So what happened 6 to 12 thousand years ago? What is the lost history? Are there some theories they are not telling us about? I would love to hear if people have more information on this topic.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 12, "score_up": 26, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1ATVCkzCcS", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 46, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8821558, "raw_content": "", "author": "Poobah", "created": 1788773638562, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "michealr24", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": fal